{
  "provider": {
    "version": 0,
    "block": {
      "attributes": {
        "api_key": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "ZTNet API key. Can also be set via `ZTNET_API_KEY` environment variable.",
          "description_kind": "markdown",
          "optional": true,
          "sensitive": true
        },
        "api_url": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "ZTNet API URL (e.g., `https://ztnet.example.com/api/v1`). Can also be set via `ZTNET_API_URL` environment variable.",
          "description_kind": "markdown",
          "optional": true
        }
      },
      "description": "\nThe ZTNet provider allows you to manage ZTNet organizations, ZeroTier networks, and network members.\n\n## Configuration\n\nThe provider can be configured using the following attributes or environment variables:\n\n- `api_url` or `ZTNET_API_URL`: The ZTNet API URL\n- `api_key` or `ZTNET_API_KEY`: The ZTNet API key\n\n## Example Usage\n\n```hcl\nprovider \"ztnet\" {\n  api_url = \"https://ztnet.example.com/api/v1\"\n  api_key = var.ztnet_api_key\n}\n```\n",
      "description_kind": "markdown"
    }
  },
  "resource_schemas": {
    "ztnet_member": {
      "version": 0,
      "block": {
        "attributes": {
          "authorized": {
            "type": "bool",
            "description": "Authorization status. Default: true.",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "optional": true,
            "computed": true
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Composite ID (network_id:member_id).",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "computed": true
          },
          "ip_assignments": {
            "type": [
              "list",
              "string"
            ],
            "description": "Assigned IP addresses (read-only, managed by ZeroTier).",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "computed": true
          },
          "last_seen": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Last seen timestamp (Unix milliseconds).",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "computed": true
          },
          "member_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "ZeroTier node ID (10 hex characters).",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "required": true
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Member display name.",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "optional": true
          },
          "network_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Network ID.",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "required": true
          },
          "online": {
            "type": "bool",
            "description": "Current online status.",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "computed": true
          },
          "org_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Organization ID.",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "required": true
          },
          "zerotier_version": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "ZeroTier client version.",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "computed": true
          }
        },
        "description": "Manages a network member authorization in ZTNet.\n\n## Example Usage\n\n```hcl\nresource \"ztnet_member\" \"jed_laptop\" {\n  org_id     = ztnet_organization.example.id\n  network_id = ztnet_network.dev.id\n  member_id  = \"abc123def456\"\n\n  authorized = true\n  name       = \"jed-laptop\"\n}\n```",
        "description_kind": "markdown"
      }
    },
    "ztnet_network": {
      "version": 0,
      "block": {
        "attributes": {
          "creation_time": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Creation timestamp (Unix milliseconds).",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "computed": true
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "16-character ZeroTier network ID.",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "computed": true
          },
          "ip_assignment_pools": {
            "nested_type": {
              "attributes": {
                "end": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "End IP address of the pool.",
                  "description_kind": "plain",
                  "computed": true
                },
                "start": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Start IP address of the pool.",
                  "description_kind": "plain",
                  "computed": true
                }
              },
              "nesting_mode": "list"
            },
            "description": "IP assignment pools (read-only, managed by ZeroTier).",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "computed": true
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Network name.",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "optional": true,
            "computed": true
          },
          "org_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Organization ID.",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "required": true
          },
          "private": {
            "type": "bool",
            "description": "Whether member authorization is required (read-only, managed by ZeroTier).",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "computed": true
          },
          "routes": {
            "nested_type": {
              "attributes": {
                "target": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Target CIDR (e.g., 10.0.0.0/24).",
                  "description_kind": "plain",
                  "computed": true
                },
                "via": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Gateway IP address (null for local routes).",
                  "description_kind": "plain",
                  "computed": true
                }
              },
              "nesting_mode": "list"
            },
            "description": "Managed routes (read-only, managed by ZeroTier).",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "computed": true
          }
        },
        "description": "Manages a ZeroTier network within a ZTNet organization.\n\n## Example Usage\n\n```hcl\nresource \"ztnet_network\" \"dev\" {\n  org_id  = ztnet_organization.example.id\n  name    = \"myproject-dev\"\n  private = false\n}\n```",
        "description_kind": "markdown"
      }
    },
    "ztnet_organization": {
      "version": 0,
      "block": {
        "attributes": {
          "created_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Creation timestamp.",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "computed": true
          },
          "description": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Organization description.",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "optional": true
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Organization ID.",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "computed": true
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Organization name.",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "required": true
          },
          "owner_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Owner user ID.",
            "description_kind": "plain",
            "computed": true
          }
        },
        "description": "Manages a ZTNet organization.\n\n## Example Usage\n\n```hcl\nresource \"ztnet_organization\" \"example\" {\n  name        = \"MyProject\"\n  description = \"My infrastructure project\"\n}\n```",
        "description_kind": "markdown"
      }
    }
  },
