        "description": "Look up an existing ZeroTier network by ID.\n\n## Example Usage\n\n```hcl\ndata \"ztnet_network\" \"existing\" {\n  org_id     = data.ztnet_organization.existing.id\n  network_id = \"a1b2c3d4e5f67890\"\n}\n```",
